window.docContents[45].resolve({"/Terms-and-Sorts/#Cvc___lean----High-Level-CVC5-API--Terms-and-Sorts--Sorts":{"contents":"Cvc.lean associates some Lean types to cvc5-sorts Srt through the ToTyp class.\n\nAssociates a Typ to a Type.Typ associated to a type through ToTyp.\n\nToTyp α specifies a Typ-value for α that corresponds to a Srt.But is not a\nSrt as constructing one requires to be in Env: a Srt value is tied to a specific manager.\nThis lets us go from compatible Lean types to Srt directly.\n\n#eval Env.runIO do\n  let b ← Srt.of Bool\n  println! \"b := {b}\"\n  let i ← Srt.of Int\n  println! \"i := {i}\"\n  let r ← Srt.of Rat\n  println! \"r := {r}\"\n  let bv ← Srt.of (BitVec 8)\n  println! \"bv := {bv}\"\n\n\nb := Bool\ni := Int\nr := Real\nbv := (_ BitVec 8)\n\n\nCvc.lean exposes two API-s for terms: Typed and Untyped.\n\n","context":"Cvc.lean -- High-Level CVC5 API\u0009Terms and Sorts","header":"2.1. Sorts","id":"/Terms-and-Sorts/#Cvc___lean----High-Level-CVC5-API--Terms-and-Sorts--Sorts"}});